5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I hate doing math before turning on the heater. It feels like a test.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to see the full year's data before I agree to anything.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,Who is actually doing the monthly calculations? It takes forever.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The old split was for three people. We are five now.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I worry that asking for money is starting to hurt our friendship.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, if we don't know the cost, we can't plan.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, exactly. I need to know the winter spike.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, I think the workload is the real problem here.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the workload is a symptom. The fairness is the issue.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, I agree. We need to see where the tension comes from.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will check the sunlight in our rooms to see who needs heat.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will look at the last twelve utility statements to see the range.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will check the monthly settle at another house to see the time cost.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the plug-in monitor readings to see who uses what.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will check the payment log to see when we get late.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,"Also, I will check the winter habits at a house paying ahead.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,And I will check the electrician's quote for the rooms.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I will also check the trial run of a reconciliation template.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will also check the kitchen notice about the cooler.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will also check settling up when the last rooms filled.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
