35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"The south rooms stay warm, but the north ones need heat early.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"February was 29,400 yen. August was only 9,100. The swing is huge.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,The other house spent forty minutes just logging readings. That is a lot.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,One room uses four times the power of another. It is not equal.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,We were late three times last year. It always causes arguments.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, that swing means a flat rate is risky for us.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, yes. The electrician quote is 34,000 yen per room. Expensive.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if usage is so different, maybe we should meter?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, metering is expensive, but it is honest.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, the late payments happened because the amounts changed.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"I saw that at the other house, they just left the heater on.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The reconciliation template took hours to fill out. Too much work.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,The template is too complex. We need something simpler.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The cooler notice stayed up all summer. People were scared to use it.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"When the new people moved in, it took three weeks to settle.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I think we need a system that doesn't require constant checking.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am worried about the upfront cost of meters.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,I don't want to be the one doing the math every month.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I want to pay for what I use, not what others waste.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I want to stop the awkwardness of asking for money.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
